  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Raeli ne abona ali se asaalila Yakobo omwana tawe, abubila wandaaye mala aboolela Yakobo ali, “Mbe babaana, namwe ese ndafwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akhalalila Raeli mala aloma ali, “Ese ndi mu bubweyaangu bwa Wele owakhukhiingilila khusaala babaana?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raeli amuboolela ali, “Nasioobi wase Biliia ali ano mubukule mala okone naye, asaalile, nio nyoole babaana khubirira mu niye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio amua Bilia abe nga omukhasi wewe mala Yakobo akona ne Biliia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliia aesia mala asaalila Yakobo omwana owe sisoleeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Raeli aloma ali, “Wele akhalakile bulayi, lundi aulile lisaba liase mala ambeele omwana owe sisoleeli.” Khwako amutiuukha lisina ali Dani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liboola lili “khalakila bulayi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliia, omukholi owa Raeli, aesia lundi mala asaalila Yakobo omwana owe sisoleeli okhola khabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raeli aloma ali, “Narekaane chimbasi burafu ne wandaayase mala nauliile”, nio amutiuukha lisina ali Nafutali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nafutali:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liliekesia “khupana.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Lea amanya ali ayakama khusaala babaana, abukula Silipa, omukholi wewe, amua Yakobo nga omukhasi wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silipa asaalila Yakobo omwana owe sisoleeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala Lea aloma ali, “Ekhabi endayi.” Nio amutiuukha lisina ali Kati",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kati:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sifuno sie lisina lino mu Lueburania sili “ekhabi endayi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silipa asaalila Yakobo omwana okhola khabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala Lea aloma ali, “Ndi ne busangaafu sikila bakhasi baliindanga bali musangaafu,” nio amutiuukha lisina ali Asieri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Asieri:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sifuno sie lisina lino mu Lueburania sili “sangaala.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaalo che khukesa engaanu Rubeni acha emukuunda anyoolayo chimbuunwe mala achireerera Lea maayi wewe. Raeli asaba Lea ali, “Nosiima mbeekho chimbuunwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "chimbuunwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "bino biaba bisala nibio beyikinanga nga kamanyasi ke khung'oona lisaaye ne busiime akari wo museecha no mukhasi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " cho omwana wowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea aamureeba ali, “Okhanyalikha ne khukhumbukula omuseecha tawe? Luno wenya khubukula aakhaba chimbuunwe cho mwana wase chosi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raeli aaloma ali, “Silo sia luno kane abe ne nawe khulwe chimbuunwe cho omwana wowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli ekolooba, Yakobo akobola khukhwama emukuunda, Lea arura acha amwakaanila mala amuboolela ali, “Luno ocha khukona mu mwase sikila nakhukulile khulwe chimbuunwe cho omwana wase.” Nio siilo aaba ne Lea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele aulila lisaba lia Lea mala aesia, asaalila Yakobo omwana owe sisoleeli okhola kharaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea aloma ali, “Wele ambeele kumuruuru kwase, sikila naelesia omuseecha wase omukholi wase.” Nio amutiuukha lisina ali Isakari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Isakari:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liboola lili “omundu aandiikwe kimilimo,” nende “kumuruuru kuliio.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea aesia lundi, mala asaalila Yakobo omwana owe sisoleeli okhola sita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea aloma ali, “Wele ambeele siaanwa silayi. Luno omuseecha wase alangoosia, sikila namusaaliile babaana be sisoleeli sita” Nio amutiuukha lisina ali Sebuluni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sebuluni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liboola lili “fukiilila” ne “siaanwa.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano Lea asaala omwana owe siikhaana mala amutiuukha ali Tina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele akhebulila Raeli, mala auulila lisaba liewe, amwikula enda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aesia mala asaala omwana owe sisoleeli. Aloma ali, “Wele andusiisiekho chisoni chase” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutiuukha lisina ali Yosefu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yosefu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liboola lili “akhoya ambelesia okundi” nende “Abukuule.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ne aloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhoya andasakho omwana owe sisoleeli okundi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akachula ne Labani ke kumuruungo kwewe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli Raeli asaalile Yosefu, Yakobo aboolela Labani ali, “Ndekhuule nje, ngobole engo mu sibala siase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbe bakhasi base ne babaana base nibo nanyoola khulwe khukhukholela ewe, mala undekhe nje, sikila ewe omanyile bukholi nibwo nakhukholeele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Labani amukobosia ali, “Waaba ne ufukiilila, ndaloma ndi, namanyile khubirira mu bulakusi bwase ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ambiitile ese chikhabi sikila ewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boola kumuruungo kwowo, mala ndakhua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amukobosia ali, “Ewe wamwene omanyile nga nakhukholeele, lundi nga chikhaafu chowo ne chakuchile mu bwaayi bwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese ne ekhecha tawe, waba nacho ngekhe busa chiri, ne luno chakuchile lukali. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhubiitile ewe chikhabi buli abuundu niio ese nacha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ese nacha:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "namwe “sikila ese.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ne ese nase ndinyoola liina bie khurumikhira munju mwase?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani amureeba ali, “Khuruunge siina?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amukobosia ali, “Se nenya kumuruungo kwosi kwosi tawe. Waaba ne ukholela nga nja khuloma, aba nja khukhwayila kamatuuli kowo lundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekhe mbire mwituuli liowo endaalo yino ndusiemo buli likheese ling'enda nende lie kamapala nende buli limeeme limali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "buli limeeme limali:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "likaluukhasia lilala lie khaale liakaluukhasibwa lili buli limeeme limali, ne Lueburania luli buli likheese ling'enda lie kamapala nende buli limeeme limali.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "” lundi buli embusi eye kamapala ne ng'enda khukhwama mu mbusi. Bibienebio bibe kumuruungo kwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio mu ndaalo chichiicha bubwiyikinwa bwase bubweene bulibonekha, nga ne oliicha khukhunduunga. Ne olinyoola embusi ekhali eng'enda namwe eye kamapala tawe namwe limeeme liosi liosi likhali limali tawe, lilibalikha nga lie bubwifwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani akobosia ali, “Bulayi! Lekha kabe nga ne olomile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne endaalo eyo Labani arusia mu munyele chindurume ching'enda nende che kamapala ne bisoonga bing'enda nende bie kamapala. Buli eyabakho lipala liwaanga ne buli limeeme limali, mala arakho babaana bewe basoleeli khubiliinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala abiaula khukhwama khu nibio niye ali nabio biaba nga lukeendo lwe chindaalo chitaru khukhwama ao. Mala Yakobo aya kumunyele kukwarama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo abukula chisaala chindeeyi che kumwilima kumubisi, ne alumondi lwe kumwarakuumba achoobula kamoola akhola kimitiindi kimiwaanga kibonekhele mu sakia ng'ene echo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abukula chisakia nicho aaba ne obuule, mala achira amafubukho niio bibiaayo biechanga ne binywelao kameechi. Ne nga bibiaayo bielukhanga ne bichile khunywa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiminyele kielukhila ebweeni we chisakia echo, nio kiasaala chimelamela, ching'enda nende che kamapala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aula kamameeme mala akobosia ematuuli ke chinjululusi ne kamamali koosi mu lituuli lia Labani. Mala aula lituuli liewe aliira alubeka, se alitubasia ne lia Labani tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga bibiaayo binefu bie mu lituuli bielukha, Yakobo abukula lusaala olwo arura mu mafubukho ebweeni we lituuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
